<title>JAPAN: Fudo Building - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fudo Building - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		   9.7		vs	   10.69</p>
<p> Operating   loss 629    million    vs    loss 66    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 703    million    vs   loss 186    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 678    million    vs   loss 197    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 64.20 yen	  vs    loss 18.69 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fudo Building Research Co Ltd is mainly involved in housing construction.</p>
</text>
